    "product_short_description": "<div class=\"advaya-product-details\">   <p class=\"lead-summary\">\n    <strong>Potent brightening serum that fades spots, evens tone,\n      boosts radiance.</strong>\n  </p>      <h3>Product Benefits</h3>   <div class=\"benefits-content\">\n      <p>1. Fades Pigmentation &amp; Dark Spots:<br/>A powerhouse blend\n      of Vitamin C, Kojic Acid, and Alpha Arbutin helps inhibit melanin\n      production, lightening dark spots, sun damage, and acne scars\n      naturally over time.</p>\n    <p>2. Evens Out Skin Tone:<br/>Niacinamide and Azelaic Acid refine\n      uneven texture and minimize redness, revealing a visibly brighter,\n      smoother, and more uniform complexion.</p>\n    <p>3. Boosts Radiance &amp; Hydration:<br/>Enriched with Hyaluronic\n      Acid, Aloe Vera, and Panthenol, this serum deeply hydrates and\n      plumps skin \u2014 leaving it soft, supple, and glowing.</p>\n    <p>4. Antioxidant Protection:<br/>Green Tea, Gotu Kola, and Turmeric\n      Extracts protect against pollution, free radicals, and premature\n      aging, promoting youthful, resilient skin.</p>\n    <p>5. Gentle Skin Renewal:<br/>Mild exfoliation from Mandelic &amp;\n      Azelaic acids helps remove dull, dead cells and promotes cell\n      turnover without irritation, even for sensitive skin.</p>   </div>\n    <h3>How to Use &amp; Rituals</h3>   <div class=\"usage-content\">\n      <p>When to Use:<br/>Day: After cleansing &amp; toning, before\n      moisturizer &amp; SPF.<br/>Night: After cleansing &amp; toning,\n      followed by a night cream or hydrating gel.</p>\n    <p>How to Use:<br/>Apply 2\u20133 drops on clean, damp skin.<br/>Gently\n      pat until absorbed.<br/>Follow with moisturizer or sunscreen\n      (AM).<br/>Use daily, morning &amp; night, for best results.</p>\n    <p>Storage:<br/>Keep in a cool, dark place, away from direct\n      sunlight to preserve Vitamin C potency.</p>\n    <p>WHY USERS WILL LOVE IT<br/>This serum combines the power of\n      Ayurvedic herbs with modern actives to deliver visible results\n      without harshness.<br/>It feels lightweight, absorbs quickly, and\n      gives an instant glow with consistent brightening over time.</p>\n    <p>Loved By:<br/>Those with dull, pigmented, or uneven skin\n      tone<br/>People with acne marks, tanning, or post-inflammatory\n      pigmentation<br/>Anyone seeking a natural, luminous glow</p>\n  </div>    <h3>Ingredients</h3>   <p class=\"ingredients-list\">\n    <em>Vitamin C (Ethyl Ascorbic Acid 10%) Niacinamide (5%) Kojic Acid\n      (2%) Alpha Arbutin (1%) Azelaic Acid (2%) Mandelic Acid (1%)\n      Licorice Root Extract Turmeric Extract Gotu Kola Extract Green Tea\n      Extract Hyaluronic Acid Aloe Vera Juice Panthenol (Vitamin B5)\n      Allantoin Sodium PCA Glycerin (plant-derived) Aqua (Distilled\n      Water) Xanthan Gum (Natural Thickener) Phenoxyethanol &amp;\n      Ethylhexylglycerin (Eco-certified preservative) Natural Essential\n      Oils for mild fragrance</em>\n  </p>      <div class=\"product-guarantee\">     <p>? <strong>100% Vegan\n        &amp; Cruelty Free</strong> | ?\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Formulated for Indian\n      Skin</strong> | ? <strong>Safe &amp; Non-Toxic</strong>\n    </p>   </div> </div>",
